  "details": "Recently, in video recording, you can now switch the Audio Listener's position between viewpoint-based and camera-based in both the camera's stream mode and the VRC Drone's FPV mode.\n\nPlease enable Udon to also retrieve the current location of the player's Audio Listener. This will ensure that world audio sources, which were previously controlled based on the player's ear position, will now be heard accurately even in stream mode.",
